Executor already provides its own Code Mode runtime, so it should be opted out of OpenCode's outer Code Mode aggregation. Set `codemode: false` on that MCP server:

```jsonc
{
  "mcp": {
    "servers": {
      "executor": {
        "type": "remote",
        "url": "http://localhost:4789/mcp",
        "oauth": false,
        "codemode": false
      }
    }
  }
}
```

This exposes `executor_execute` directly to the model while Executor continues to handle its own internal `tools.search()` calls.
